WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
UNCX builds the tools that keep DeFi secure from day one.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Now we're bringing them to HyperSwap on Hyperliquid.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
When projects launch, liquidity can be risky.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
If it's not locked, it can be pulled.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
UNCX locks make sure that can't happen, giving traders real confidence.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
HyperSwap is the trading hub of the Hyperliquid ecosystem.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
With this update, projects can now lock their liquidity directly through UNCX.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Every lock shows full details and unlock times.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
So anyone can verify what's safe, right on-chain.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
UNCX and HyperSwap together bring trusted liquidity to Hyperliquid,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
making every launch safer for builders and investors alike.
